dy":{"size":3049,"base64_url_content":null,"content":"Macro Pro is the most comprehensive investing research package we offer.\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/macro-pro-full-price/2sdm6cq/1419373518?h=lOHWeI4tX9BGj6Bee_yQqYNU0ovAA8X8gdERupJYCUc\r\n\r\nDear Timothy,\r\n\r\nUpgrade your membership to Macro Pro for access to our Q4 2023 Quarterly Macro Themes presentation this Thursday, September 28 at 11:00am ET.\r\n\r\nArmed with a 150+ slide deck—Hedgeye CEO Keith McCullough will deliver an in-depth explanation of our most timely and actionable market calls and ideas as we enter the final quarter of the year. Keith will also discuss our Current Investment Positions by Trade, Trend, and Tail.\r\n\r\nMacro Pro subscribers also receive The Morning Shift, which provides actionable email snapshots highlighting what Keith is buying and selling in his long-only account, in addition to intraday ETF position changes and re-rankings.\r\n\r\nUPGRADE TO MACRO PRO: https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/macro-pro-full-price/2sdm6cq/1419373518?h=lOHWeI4tX9BGj6Bee_yQqYNU0ovAA8X8gdERupJYCUc\r\n\r\nHere’s Hedgeye Sales team member Danny New with a rundown of what else this premium subscription tier provides:\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/bMWg2MyXVUo/2sdm6ct/1419373518?h=lOHWeI4tX9BGj6Bee_yQqYNU0ovAA8X8gdERupJYCUc\r\n\r\nNot sure what is included?\r\n\r\nGET A SUBSCRIPTION WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\nEmail: :support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\n________\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\nABOUT HEDGEYE\r\n\r\nHedgeye Risk Management is an independent investment research and online financial media company, focused exclusively on generating and delivering thoughtful investment ideas in a proven buy-side process. The firm combines quantitative, bottom-up and macro analysis with an emphasis on timing.\r\n\r\nThe firm combines quantitative, bottom-up and macro analysis with an emphasis on timing. The Hedgeye team features some of the most highly-regarded research analysts on Wall Street, covering Macro, Financials, Healthcare, Retail, Gaming, Lodging & Leisure (GLL), Restaurants, China, REITS, Industrials, Communications, Consumer Staples, Housing, Materials, Technology, Demography and Washington policy analysis, including Macro, Telecom & Media, and Healthcare.\r\n \r\n\r\nUse of Hedgeye and any other products available through hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/2023-09-27/2sdm6cx/1419373518?h=lOHWeI4tX9BGj6Bee_yQqYNU0ovAA8X8gdERupJYCUc\r\n\r\n are subject to our Terms of Service\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-o-/2sdm6d1/1419373518?h=lOHWeI4tX9BGj6Bee_yQqYNU0ovAA8X8gdERupJYCUc\r\n\r\n and Privacy Policy\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-b-/2sdm6d4/1419373518?h=lOHWeI4tX9BGj6Bee_yQqYNU0ovAA8X8gdERupJYCUc\r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCopyright © 2023, All rights reserved.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tHedgeye Risk Management LLC\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t1 High Ridge Park\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tStamford, CT 06905\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUpdate your email preferences\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/hedgeye-email-preference-center?ehash=28e5ac2768859b27e0b97984a5d8375da495f57468d52861032537bebb56fdfd&email_id=1419373518&epc_hash=e8GCxiI5fC6RZk5YsORvoNBb7uhNtHm2Y8CHO5BNC3E\r\n\r\n\r\n","attachment_id":null},"read_attachment_supported":null,"parts":null},{"part_id":"1","mime_type":"text/html","filename":"","headers":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"text/html; charset=\"utf-8\""},{"name":"Content-Transfer-Encoding","value":"8bit"}],"body":{"size":19302,"base64_url_content":null,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" />\r\n    <!-- Facebook sharing information tags -->\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"4Q Macro Themes Tomorrow ➡️ Get Access\" />\r\n\r\n    <title>4Q Macro 